# Read by wrangler: files here are never uploaded, whatever is on disk.
#
# The Mapbox configuration belongs at the root of releases/, shared by every
# version. scripts/build-release.mjs sweeps the copy Vite inherits from
# public/ out of the version directory, but a build cut short before that
# step (a failed step, or output piped into `grep -m1`) leaves it behind, and
# on 2026-10-13 that copy was deployed as /ver-3/mapbox.json. This makes the
# deploy refuse it even then.
ver-*/mapbox.json
